<title>SINGAPORE: NatSteel expands share in NatSteel Braodway.</title>
<headline>NatSteel expands share in NatSteel Braodway.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steel manufacturer NatSteel Ltd has acquired an additional 69,000 ordinary shares of par value Singapore $0.25 each in China-based NatSteel Broadway Ltd, the company said on Friday.</p>
<p>The average price per share is US$0.654.</p>
<p>The purchase was made through its subsidiary NatSteel Equity V Pte Ltd. NatSteel Ltd now holds an aggregate of 69,593,000 ordinary share representing 51.63 percent in the issued capital of NatSteel Braodway.</p>
<p>NatSteel Broadway is a spinoff company of NatSteel Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703080) mrh</p>
</text>
